    "source": "The lead also owns the story spine, under Story, Chapters. A single beat can be reworded, skipped or promoted to the one in play without regenerating the whole arc, a chapter can be sealed early, and the whole campaign can be rewound to the start of a chapter. A rewind is destructive: it asks for confirmation and lists what it will undo first, then puts sheets, NPCs, locations, maps and quest state back the way they were.",
